<%--
_Sys_Tasks_Action - the Tasks screen: two tabs.

    tasks     - _Sys_Tasks_DataGrid (every run: active ones on top, finished below; live)
    schedules - _Sys_Tasks_Schedules (every #[Schedule] with its run statistics; Run now)

Any row opens the run (_Sys_Task_Detail) in a dialog; a row's buttons act on it. The active
tab is the hash key "tab"; the grid's state is under the grid key "tasks".
--%>
<Define:_Sys_Tasks_Action>
<_Sys_Page_Scaffold class="_Sys_Page_Scaffold--wide">
    <Slot:main>
        <_Sys_Tabs $sid="tabs" $hash="tab" $tabs=([
            {key: 'tasks', label: 'Tasks', icon: 'bi-list-check'},
            {key: 'schedules', label: 'Schedules', icon: 'bi-calendar-event'},
        ])>
            <Slot:tasks><_Sys_Tasks_DataGrid $sid="tasks" /></Slot:tasks>
            <Slot:schedules><_Sys_Tasks_Schedules $sid="schedules" /></Slot:schedules>
        </_Sys_Tabs>
    </Slot:main>
</_Sys_Page_Scaffold>
</Define:_Sys_Tasks_Action>
